      <marc:subfield code="a">As the book poignantly asks: why must such cruelty and sorrow happen so early in life? Why must children bear these burdens? The world offers no answers—only art and creativity can try to mend and soothe. Every day can be a dark day, and every day can also be a bright one. This picture book is Jimmy Liao’s expression of compassion—for the world, and especially for children. It represents the only power we have, and also the greatest one</marc:subfield>
